ont-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_af443b14-5c6b-4465-b73c-b1b1e5755e06" contextRef="C_1c0bd242-5d35-461c-89b0-5af72f425ee1" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCash" unitRef="U_CNY" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">16.9</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million (approximately US$</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c9ab3a05-deb0-4a67-a587-ca2b02ab8012" contextRef="C_1c0bd242-5d35-461c-89b0-5af72f425ee1" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCash" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million) due to asset preservation measures on certain bank accounts. The Group concluded that the ultimate outcome of this arbitration would not have a material adverse effect on the Group's results of operations, consolidated financial condition, or cash flows.</span></p></ix:continuation></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div><ix:nonNumeric id="F_54d41c28-2ca0-473c-a69a-37657b05a5b3" contextRef="C_db79df8c-3b05-4313-b1f6-4d288fd0d908" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_54d41c28-2ca0-473c-a69a-37657b05a5b3_1"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:18pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-sp