an style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">board of directors. Shares granted under the 2026 Plan are generally subject to only service condition but with multiple vesting schedules. As of March 31, 2026</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_6f6f2856-8e1c-4ba1-a5b2-8cd91efa9b45" contextRef="C_5e6e4836-4aa4-4d9a-883b-02192936b947" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,600,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> of such share awards have been granted.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
